            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Task_Dependency</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes : Parent Record Exist</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>AZD-447254 : Update Parent Task Status when Child Task is Updated

1) When one of child task status = Complete  then Set Parent = In Progress , 2) When Mix of of child task status = Complete and Canceled then Set Parent = Complete ,3) When all child task status = Complete  then Set Parent = Complete 4) When all child task status = Canceled  then Set Parent = Canceled

AZD-500937 : Added Validation logic for Task Dependency and Preceding Task.
12/6/2025 - Added Logic to Stop Updating the Parent Task When Status = Closed Moved</description>
